<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94895" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκῐό-εις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span> (neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιόειν</span> metri gr., <i><span class="en">
			A.R.
			2.404
		</span></i>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shady,
				shadowy</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔρεα, ὄρεα
			ς</span>., <i>shady</i>, i.e. <i>thickly wooded</i>,
			mountains, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.157
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				7.268
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				9.34
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέγαρα ς</span>. <i>dark</i>
			chambers, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.365
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.768
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρθρον ὑπὸ σκιόεντα</span>
			the morning twilight, <i><span class="en">
				Tryph.
				236
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέφεα ς</span>.
				<i>overshadowing</i> clouds, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.525
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.374
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>unsubstantial</i>, of a reflection in a mirror, and of the
			shadow on a sun-dial, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.20
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				9.807
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρδος ὀνείρου</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				11.366
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
